  <bns:encryptedValues/>
  <bns:description>Business logic for files pushed by Axway SecureTransport (Generic-HTTP(S) site, PUT). ST wraps the file in multipart/form-data: the first step unwraps it (filename from the part header, original bytes as the document); raw bodies pass through with ?filename= as fallback. Empty files are rejected with an exception so ST marks the transfer Failed. Writes an audit line and returns a JSON receipt. Add downstream routing (store/transform/forward) after the audit step. | built with boomi-companion v1.0.103</bns:description>
  <bns:object>
    <process allowSimultaneous="false" enableUserLog="false" processLogOnErrorOnly="false" purgeDataImmediately="false" stopProcessingIfZeroDocuments="true" updateRunDates="false" workload="general">
